          "text": "Témoignages: (CAN) CHASSENEUIL-DU-POITOU (86) 24.09.2009",
          "text_sha256": "78844b307bf0176b40c7ff6abc9abfcf53c39d0b3dc1401be89cd62549013b4f"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
